# Model artifacts are regenerated by scripts EXCEPT models/artifacts/,
# which is committed on purpose: no GPU exists in CI or on Render (plan
# §13), so the served GNN/GBDT weights (`python -m models.train_production`)
# can only ever be trained locally and shipped as static files.
*.pkl
*.npz
!models/artifacts/**

